o selects the music, Joe was just the provider! What a great way to collaborate right? Since we will be at SXSW from (March 11-16) there won't be a live Soulection Radio show next week, however, we do have a special guest mix to make up for it. Stay tuned.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10818,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-03-08T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"MOmx8EKhDCc","position":3,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Eric Lau - I’ve gotta keep that bounce!","track":{"id":"JVPMxDofHkA","path":"/artists/eric-lau/tracks/i-ve-gotta-keep-that-bounce/","slug":"ive-gotta-keep-that-bounce","title":"I’ve gotta keep that bounce!","artist":{"slug":"eric-lau","title":"Eric Lau"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"w4gYRLgk3zs","slug":"193","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-193-w-sosupersam-hannah-faith-yukibeb-kronika-eden-hagos"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #193 w/ SoSuperSam, Hannah Faith, Sasha Marie, Yukibeb, Kronika, & Eden","artwork":"/images/episodes/193.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10871,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-11-15T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Hannah Faith's Set","position":2}},{"id":"S-S7bSvdoQU","position":20,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Eric Lau - Dillalight (Joe Kay's Slowed Edit)","track":{"id":"pKcFJmtnlSE","path":"/artists/eric-lau/tracks/dillalight-joe-kay-s-slowed-edit/","slug":"dillalight-joe-kays-slowed-edit","title":"Dillalight (Joe Kay's Slowed Edit)","artist":{"slug":"eric-lau","title":"Eric Lau"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"s9V9Fge9BTw","slug":"291","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-291/ra.1191631113","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-291"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Rad